        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2017 Supercheap Auto Bathurst 1000, Bathurst 1000, Bathurst 12 Hour\n- Places: Mount Panorama Circuit, Mount Panorama, Wahluu\n- Topics: Supercars, motor racing\n\nFacts:\n- The 2017 Supercheap Auto Bathurst 1000 was scheduled as a Supercars motor racing event on the weekend of 5 to 8 October 2017.\n- Mount Panorama Circuit is situated on a hill with the dual official names Mount Panorama and Wahluu.\n- Mount Panorama Circuit is best known as the home of the Bathurst 1000 motor race held each October.\n- Mount Panorama Circuit is also the home of the Bathurst 12 Hour event held each February.",
